          "en": "Two consistency refinements at the observed decision points, without expanding policy scope. First, late general bound-subject, data-flow and heading-scope clauses must defer to the already qualified finite provider-name and covered-stock-cookie exceptions; directional summaries must remain consistent with a verified basis and a harmless removed-side ledger. The preceding main reply calls both provider deltas harmless and then denies replacement solely for that same name, while coverage reactivates the covered copy as a category obligation. Second, equivalent same-language form/privacy phrasing is not a separate substantive body-language version solely because its style differs; require an actual changed meaning or condition. The preceding authentication reply explicitly retains synonymous Vietnamese wording for pretraining despite equivalent meaning. Preserve real action destinations, liable parties, explicit category/status/consent terms, actual changed procedures, and substantive body prose in different languages. No fields/order/enums/schema, source/window, model/sampling, native executor, validator, authority or response-envelope changes. Keep the unsuccessful explanation-first engineering intervention excluded.",
          "zh": "针对观察到的决策位置澄清两项一致性，不扩大政策范围。第一，后部一般性的主体绑定、数据流及标题作用域条款必须服从已满足条件的有限服务商名称及已覆盖通用cookie复制例外；方向汇总应与已核验依据及已归为无害的被移除侧证据一致。前一main回复把双方服务商差异均判为无害，却仅因同一名称否认替换；coverage则把已覆盖复制文字重新当成类别义务。第二，等价的同语言表单及隐私措辞，不因风格不同就成为独立实质正文语言版本；必须存在实际意义或条件变化。前一认证回复明确为预训练保留语义等价的越南语近义措辞。真实操作去向、责任主体、明确类别及状态同意条款、实际流程变化和不同语言实质正文继续保护。不改字段、顺序、枚举、schema、原文及窗口、模型采样、原生执行器、校验器、权限或回复外层格式。继续排除未成功的先解释工程干预。"
